<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Parent portal | Raj University</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/app.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/account.css"></head>
<body class="login-page"><a class="login-brand brand" href="index.jsp"><span class="brand-mark">R</span><span>raj<span class="brand-muted">university</span></span></a><main class="login-layout"><section class="login-intro"><span class="eyebrow">PARENT PORTAL</span><h1>Stay close to<br><span>their progress.</span></h1><p>See attendance, semester results, and academic updates from one calm, clear place.</p><div class="login-points"><span>◔ <b>Attendance updates</b></span><span>◒ <b>Semester results</b></span><span>▤ <b>Course updates</b></span></div></section><section class="login-card"><div class="card-top"><span class="eyebrow">PARENT SIGN IN</span><span class="secure">◉ Secure login</span></div><h2>Welcome back</h2><p class="card-copy">Sign in with the parent account linked to your student.</p><% if (request.getAttribute("error") != null) { %><div class="form-error"><%= request.getAttribute("error") %></div><% } %><% if ("true".equals(request.getParameter("registered"))) { %><div class="form-success">Parent account created. You can sign in now.</div><% } %><form action="parent1" method="get"><label for="mailid">Parent email</label><input id="mailid" type="email" name="mailid" placeholder="parent@example.com" required><label for="parent-password">Password</label><input id="parent-password" type="password" name="password" placeholder="Enter your password" required><button class="primary-button full-button" type="submit">Open parent portal <span>→</span></button></form><div class="login-divider"><span>First time here?</span></div><a class="outline-button full-button" href="parent-register.jsp">Create parent account</a><a class="role-link" href="student.jsp">Student login →</a><small class="login-legal">Parent access is linked to the student email provided during registration.</small></section></main><a class="back-home" href="index.jsp">← Back to home</a></body>
</html>
